  <section class="wrap fiche-body">
    <div>
      <h2>The vibe</h2>
      <p>L'Origane is a guest house on the heights of the village of L'Escarène (3918 chemin des Camps), in the Nice hinterland, 30 minutes from Nice and 45 minutes from Monaco. It offers 2 guest rooms on a separate floor (up to 5 people, each with its own bathroom) and a table d'hôtes, set in a 2-hectare olive grove with a pool in season. Open all year.</p>

      <h2>Dogs: pets not accepted</h2>
      <p>The tourist office listing (Côte d'Azur France, updated by the Pays des Paillons community of communes) states "<strong>Animals not accepted</strong>". The establishment's own website showed the same policy when we last read it (unfenced grounds, risk of conflict with the dogs and cats of the house); it could not be reached on 07/11/2026.</p>
      <p>Two specialised directories (emmenetonchien.com, last updated February 2023, a traveller's testimony) once described a free welcome for 2 dogs under 30 kg, with bowl and basket on request. That information predates the current sources, so we no longer rely on it.</p>
      <p><strong>Worth checking before you go:</strong> if you still wish to stay here with your dog, ask the establishment for confirmation before booking.</p>

      <h2>Nearby</h2>
      <p>The village of L'Escarène and its 17th-century bridge can be visited on foot; the Paillon valley is crisscrossed by hiking trails.</p>
